          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Tôi sẽ về ngay.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">３．</span></p>"
